        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122839503?u=fd7c151b335adbbe5acad365fcc96d8d608be54c&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fix typo in <code class=\"notranslate\">translateX()</code> for the underlying transform value.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Made a typo in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4653397294\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44431\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/44431/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44431\">#44431</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">N/A</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">N/A</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44521",
            "title": "Fix underlying translateX value typo in `animation-composition`",
            "date_modified": "2026-06-19T16:07:03.000Z",
