        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #44503.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4692341052\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44503\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44503/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44503\">#44503</a> following changes in browser-spec (see the issue for background)</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Lots of URLs showing:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/610472344-a8699fa6-abcf-402e-8662-fab6fe8f9f34.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..epaFNpyITXcWVD5Z3ktH4ybWJ75bJaHgvyf8UHAFUtE\"><img width=\"394\" height=\"155\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/610472344-a8699fa6-abcf-402e-8662-fab6fe8f9f34.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..epaFNpyITXcWVD5Z3ktH4ybWJ75bJaHgvyf8UHAFUtE\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 155px;; aspect-ratio: 394 / 155; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #44503.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4692341052\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44503\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44503/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44503\">#44503</a><br>\nCaused by <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4534538459\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/browser-specs/issues/2508\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/browser-specs/pull/2508/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/browser-specs/pull/2508\">w3c/browser-specs#2508</a> and <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/browser-specs/commit/500846ed3ad95122533a8cb4194c34b7e2f6ef6c/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/browser-specs/commit/500846ed3ad95122533a8cb4194c34b7e2f6ef6c\">w3c/browser-specs@<tt>500846e</tt></a></p>\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44516",
            "title": "Fix RFC urls",
            "date_modified": "2026-06-19T13:24:10.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-06-19T13:22:12.000Z",
