            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147667317?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">This change corrects the MDN documentation about what the <code class=\"notranslate\">start</code> keyword represents when <code class=\"notranslate\">flex-direction</code> is reversed.  some descriptions and images were edited to match the correct behavior.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">These changes correctly reflect the CSS Flexible Box specifications about the behavior of where in the container the <code class=\"notranslate\">start</code> keyword indicates when <code class=\"notranslate\">flex-direction</code> is <code class=\"notranslate\">row/column-reverse</code>.  Only <code class=\"notranslate\">flex-start</code> should be changing with <code class=\"notranslate\">flex-direction</code>.  The issue covers things more in detail, but the CSS Flexible Box spec is <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-flexbox-2/#flex-direction-property\" rel=\"nofollow\">HERE</a> and these WPT tests verify the behavior: [<a href=\"https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/web_tests/external/wpt/css/css-flexbox/flexbox_justifycontent-start.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">1</a>] and [<a href=\"https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/web_tests/external/wpt/css/css-flexbox/flexbox_justifycontent-end.html?q=%22flex%22%20%22row-reverse%22%20%22justify-content:%20end%22&amp;ss=chromium\" rel=\"nofollow\">2</a>]</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fixes #<a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44505#issue-4694505022\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44505/hovercard\">44504</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44508",
            "title": "Fix CSS Flex documentation on behavior of `start` with reversed `flex-direction`",
            "date_modified": "2026-06-19T17:59:12.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-06-18T23:39:06.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "celestepan",
                "url": "https://github.com/celestepan"
            }
