            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45960703?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Delete guide for Topics API</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Google deprecated Topics API and since Google Chrome 150 invocations for field-trial enabled browsers will always reject. </p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Source: <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/_R85yctz4Rs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Intent to Deprecate and Remove: Topics API</a></p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
