        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77456300?u=05e452372074933d5f56d553a09e3f34183c31eb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds <code class=\"notranslate\">display-p3-linear</code> to the predefined color spaces.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add missing color space to align MDN docs with the spec</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">spec: <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-4/#predefined\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-4/#predefined</a></p>\n\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44496",
            "title": "Add `display-p3-linear` to predefined color spaces",
            "date_modified": "2026-06-18T19:01:39.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-06-17T12:43:59.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "priyanshurav",
                "url": "https://github.com/priyanshurav"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This change addresses the dev-doc-needed requirements of <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1891478\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1891478</a> \"Implement documentId in extension APIs\"</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Changhes include:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">New page</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>runtime/getdocumentid/index.md  — documents the new  <code class=\"notranslate\">runtime.getDocumentId()</code>  method, which returns the document UUID for a given window/frame target.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated API reference pages</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>runtime/connect/index.md  — added  <code class=\"notranslate\">documentId</code>  to  <code class=\"notranslate\">connectInfo</code>  options.</li>\n<li>runtime/sendmessage/index.md  — added  <code class=\"notranslate\">documentId</code>  to  <code class=\"notranslate\">options</code>.</li>\n<li>proxy/requestdetails/index.md  — added  <code class=\"notranslate\">documentId</code>  and  <code class=\"notranslate\">parentDocumentId</code>  properties.</li>\n<li>webnavigation/getframe/index.md  — removed a stray orphaned \"Must include one of\" line.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Navigation/index updates</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>runtime/index.md  — added a  <code class=\"notranslate\">runtime.getDocumentId()</code>  entry to the methods list.</li>\n<li>content_scripts/index.md  — added  <code class=\"notranslate\">runtime.getDocumentId()</code>  to the list of APIs usable from content scripts.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Release notes: firefox/releases/153/index.md  — new bullet under \"Changes for add-on developers\" summarizing all the  <code class=\"notranslate\">documentId</code>  additions across  <code class=\"notranslate\">runtime</code>,  <code class=\"notranslate\">scripting</code>,  <code class=\"notranslate\">userScripts</code>,  <code class=\"notranslate\">tabs</code>,  <code class=\"notranslate\">webNavigation</code>,  <code class=\"notranslate\">webRequest</code>, and  <code class=\"notranslate\">proxy</code>, referencing bug 1891478.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">BCD changes in PR <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4669607685\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29853\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29853/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29853\">mdn/browser-compat-data#29853</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44491",
            "title": "Bug 1891478 Implementation of `documentId` in more extension APIs",
            "date_modified": "2026-06-19T19:53:53.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-06-16T19:07:48.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "rebloor",
                "url": "https://github.com/rebloor"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1145425?u=16459759968caa5cb64321210634b421f8b1c894&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Removed mysterious “This, of course, applies to all other attributes as well”, mainly.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There are no other <code class=\"notranslate\">{name}.</code>-prefixed form entries associated with image buttons according to the current HTML spec (and I’m not aware of any having existed historically, but if they did, saying so isn’t very useful anyway without elaborating).</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Avoids misleading readers into thinking there are other “attributes” submitted by an image button.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44489",
            "title": "Make `<input type=\"image\">` submitted entries info more precise",
            "date_modified": "2026-06-16T17:15:33.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-06-16T17:13:32.000Z",
