        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Firefox 153 adds support for <a href=\"https://github.com/WebAssembly/js-promise-integration/blob/main/proposals/js-promise-integration/Overview.md\">WebAssembly JS Promise Integration (JS-PI)</a>: see <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2044809\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2044809</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>A <code class=\"notranslate\">WebAssembly.Suspending</code> reference.</li>\n<li>A <code class=\"notranslate\">WebAssembly.promising()</code> reference.</li>\n<li>A Fx 153 release note for the overall feature.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4666536015\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44468\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44468/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44468\">#44468</a> for tracking.</p>\n\n\n\n",
