        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF153 enables support for JavaScript text modules in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2039881\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2039881</a>.<br>\nThis adds the release note and removes the Experimental features entry.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4666393170\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44457\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44457/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44457\">#44457</a></p>",
